              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "concordar — \"to agree\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Concordo contigo: é melhor sair cedo. I agree with you: it is better to leave early."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Concordar com alguém — to agree with someone; concordar em + infinitive — to agree to do something."
            }
          ]
        },
